Legacy license provenance
=========================

The inherited getumbrel/umbrel-electrumx package at baseline commit 85fccb408708df04f3c0aea6646b44d84e0bd8c0 declared "license": "ISC" in package.json but did not include a standalone license text or copyright notice. That declaration and the repository history continue to govern the removed legacy source. The current modernization source is distributed under LICENSE.md because it derives from the approved PolyForm-licensed Litecoin Electrs interface.
